---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "./header.astro";
---
<script>
    const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(
        "[data-copy-acknowledgement]",
    );
    const text = document.querySelector("#acknowledgement-text");
    const status = document.querySelector(".copy-status");

    button?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
        if (!text || !status) return;

        try {
            await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text.textContent?.trim() ?? "");
            status.textContent = "Copied to clipboard";
        } catch {
            status.textContent = "Could not copy. Please select and copy the text manually.";
        }
    });
</script>

<Layout>
  <Header />

  <main class="content-page">
    <div class="content-container">
      <div class="page-intro">
        <h1>About</h1>
        <p>
          The UNEQUAL-HNC [LINK] study investigated patterns, trends and inequalities
          in Head and Neck Cancer (HNC) incidence and survival in England during
          the period 2016-2023.
        </p>
        <p>
          The <a href="/HNCancer/explore/">EXPLORE</a> page allows you to examine and download data tables and
          graphics for all HNC or for different subsites (Larynx, Oral Cavity,
          Oropharynx, or Other) according to combinations of patient
          demographics and diagnostic variables.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="about-1">
      <h2 id="about-1">Acknowledgement</h2>

      <p>
        The following acknowledgement should be used in any material including
        these data:
      </p>

      <div class="acknowledgement-box">
          <button
              type="button"
              class="button icon-button copy-button is-primary"
              aria-label="Copy acknowledgement text"
              data-copy-acknowledgement
          >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">
                  content_copy
              </span>
          </button>

          <div id="acknowledgement-text">
              <p>
                These analyses were downloaded from [website]: an interactive web
                resource reporting outputs of the UNEQUAL-HNC study, conducted by the
                REACH team at Newcastle University with funding from North West Cancer
                Research and Oracle Head and Neck Cancer. The analyses are based on data
                collected by NHS England.              
              </p>
          </div>

          <span class="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="about-2">
      <h2 id="about-2">Patient and Public Involvement and Engagement (PPIE)</h2>

      <p>
        People affected by head and neck cancer were integral to the design,
        conduct and outputs of UNEQUAL-HNC [LINK]. The study team included a patient
        representative and head and neck cancer survivor who advised on the
        research questions and approach for the funding application. Throughout
        the project CHANGE HNC provided input and advice to the study team on
        interpretations, new directions and public-facing outputs.
      </p>
      <p>
        We thank all PPIE contributors for their time and energy in maximising
        the impact and reach of this project.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="about-3">
      <h2 id="about-3">Funding</h2>
      <p>
        This work was supported by <a href="https://nwcr.org/"
          >North West Cancer Research</a
        > and <a href="https://oraclehnc.org.uk/">Oracle Head and Neck Cancer</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        Supplementary support came from the National Institute for Health and
        Care Research (NIHR) Newcastle Patient Safety Research Collaboration
        (PSRC). The views expressed are those of the authors and not necessarily
        those of the NIHR or the Department of Health and Social Care.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>

.acknowledgement-box {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2.5rem 3.5rem 2.5rem 2rem;
    background: var(--bulma-background);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--bulma-border);
    font-style: italic;
}

.copy-button {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.5rem;
    right: 0.5rem;
    background: transparent;
}

.copy-button .material-symbols-outlined {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
}

.copy-status {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0.75rem;
    bottom: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-style: normal;
}
</style>